   "text": "Coin $PEPE (the bidder)\n0 keys · same code as every coin\n\nbonding curve: buy / sell\nlock tokens → votes\ntreasury (1% trade fee)\nthink() → its brain decides\non_brain(): checks the AI's signature\nand every rule cap",
